220 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 87 0 R/T(This weekend sees the return of the FA Cup with the 3rd Qualifying round games being played - Barton Town are representing the NCEFL when they entertain National North side Chorley - other Step 5 clubs still involved in the competition include SE Dons from the Southern Counties East League Premier Division - Trafford FC from the North West Counties League Premier - Tadley Calleva who compete in the Cherry Red Records Combined Counties Football League - )/E(This weekend sees the return of the FA Cup with the 3rd Qualifying round games being played - Barton Town are representing the NCEFL when they entertain National North side Chorley - other Step 5 clubs still involved in the competition include SE Dons from the Southern Counties East League Premier Division - Trafford FC from the North West Counties League Premier - Tadley Calleva who compete in the Cherry Red Records Combined Counties Football League - )/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

221 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 87 0 R/T(On paper Barton look to have the most difficult task when they play Chorley - Of the other teams -Trafford play Atherton Colleries from the NPL West Division - South East Dons travel to Southern League Division 1 South \(Step 4\) side Weymouth FC - although Weymouth have suffered successive relegations they are currently sitting at the top of their league - Tadley Calleve entertain Isthmian Premier Division \(Step 3\) side Dartford FC - looking at the season\220s results to date Trafford FC would seem to have best opportunity to progress, but as we all know about football results!!!)/E(On paper Barton look to have the most difficult task when they play Chorley - Of the other teams -Trafford play Atherton Colleries from the NPL West Division - South East Dons travel to Southern League Division 1 South \(Step 4\) side Weymouth FC - although Weymouth have suffered successive relegations they are currently sitting at the top of their league - Tadley Calleve entertain Isthmian Premier Division \(Step 3\) side Dartford FC - looking at the season\220s results to date Trafford FC would seem to have best opportunity to progress, but as we all know about football results!!!)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

222 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 87 0 R/T(Back to the NCEFL and Barton Town who beat us on Tuesday are now up to 5th place in the league and with games in hand over the teams above them - having reached the play offs last season they would have been one of the pre-season favourites to be challenging - but looking at top half of the league currently you probably wouldn\220t have predicted the it as it sits at the moment, with two of the top seven - Bottesford Town 2nd at present and Horbury Town 7th - flirting with relegation right to the end last season.)/E(Back to the NCEFL and Barton Town who beat us on Tuesday are now up to 5th place in the league and with games in hand over the teams above them - having reached the play offs last season they would have been one of the pre-season favourites to be challenging - but looking at top half of the league currently you probably wouldn\220t have predicted the it as it sits at the moment, with two of the top seven - Bottesford Town 2nd at present and Horbury Town 7th - flirting with relegation right to the end last season.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

223 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 87 0 R/T(It will be interesting how the league looks at the end of the month with a lot of games to be played in the next few weeks.)/E(It will be interesting how the league looks at the end of the month with a lot of games to be played in the next few weeks.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

