225 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 87 0 R/E(The five-day trip involved the club facing one of Kuwait's most successful teams on Wednesday, Al Qadsia, who have won more than 50 trophies, before returning on Thursday to play Saturday's FA Cup third qualifying round against Dulwich Hamlet.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

